{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":485978,"name":"Robert Parker","username":"PGT","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/p/3ab097/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-08T07:21:56.072Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485978-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485978-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485978-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485978-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAgent Computer unreachable. Reset failed with “partial state.” App then shows “Can’t Reach Grok Bot’s Computer / firewall, VPN, or proxy / *.cursorvm.com.” Same account on iOS cellular hangs on the logo. No VPN/proxy/firewall on my side. Nothing changed locally. Please rebuild the Agent Computer.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485978-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485978-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOpen Grok Bot on Mac.\u003cbr\u003e\nSee “Can’t reach your computer.”\u003cbr\u003e\nSign out/in. Still unreachable.\u003cbr\u003e\nRecover/Reset → “Reset failed… computer may be in a partial state.”\u003cbr\u003e\nApp then shows the *.cursorvm.com firewall message.\u003cbr\u003e\niOS app on 5G (Wi-Fi off) stays on the logo.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485978-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485978-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eReconnect to the existing Agent Computer and load bots/files.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485978-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485978-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScreenshots / Screen Recordings\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/0/5/059726bef8fc5e52d21eee4702b0bc18e2b1a7e3.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/Nse70rkV4Je4yanzfacXh6T723.jpeg?dl=1\" title=\"content (2).png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/0/5/059726bef8fc5e52d21eee4702b0bc18e2b1a7e3_2_482x500.jpeg\" alt=\"content (2).png\" data-base62-sha1=\"Nse70rkV4Je4yanzfacXh6T723\" width=\"482\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/0/5/059726bef8fc5e52d21eee4702b0bc18e2b1a7e3_2_482x500.jpeg, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/0/5/059726bef8fc5e52d21eee4702b0bc18e2b1a7e3_2_723x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/0/5/059726bef8fc5e52d21eee4702b0bc18e2b1a7e3.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"383838\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003econtent (2).png\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e842×872 46.8 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485978-operating-system-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485978-operating-system-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMacOS\u003cbr\u003e\niOS\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485978-version-information-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485978-version-information-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u